# Copy to .env and fill in real values. .env is gitignored — never commit it.
#
# This agent itself needs no secrets — it only authors SQL/JSON/Markdown files, it never calls
# Telegram or Postgres directly. The system it builds needs its own secrets (TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN,
# Postgres credentials, OFFICE_CHAT_ID, PRINCIPAL_CHAT_ID) — those are configured inside n8n itself
# on the school's server at deploy time, documented in docs/SETUP.md, never entered here.
